1
00:00:00,229 --> 00:00:03,899
(Howard:)So you wouldn't want to
have anything on Penny?

2
00:00:03,899 --> 00:00:05,429
(Leonard:)Well, of course not.

3
00:00:05,434 --> 00:00:09,574
(Howard:)So, if I actually
know something right now...

4
00:00:09,572 --> 00:00:11,142
(Howard:)and I do...

5
00:00:12,841 --> 00:00:14,011
(Howard:)...you don't want me
to tell you?

6
00:00:14,009 --> 00:00:16,239
(Amy:)Uh...

7
00:00:16,245 --> 00:00:17,645
Pfft, no.

8
00:00:17,646 --> 00:00:20,376
I'll take that as a "Yes."

9
00:00:20,382 --> 00:00:23,422
(Howard:)She's secretly been moving
your collectibles into storage

10
00:00:23,419 --> 00:00:25,219
(Howard:)a little at a time
and you haven't noticed.

11
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,190
(Leonard:)Are you kidding me?

12
00:00:27,189 --> 00:00:28,619
(Howard:)See, I've known
that for weeks,

13
00:00:28,624 --> 00:00:30,894
(Howard:)but, you know, I waited
till the moment

14
00:00:30,893 --> 00:00:34,533
(Howard:)when it would cause him
the most pain.

15
00:00:39,535 --> 00:00:42,605
(Leonard:)Superman's gone,
my stormtrooper's gone.

16
00:00:42,605 --> 00:00:45,375
(Sheldon:)Your Klingon word-of-the-day
calendar's gone.

17
00:00:45,374 --> 00:00:47,244
I'd say "damn it" in Klingon,

18
00:00:47,242 --> 00:00:49,242
(Leonard:)but that wasn't until
next month.

19
00:00:49,244 --> 00:00:51,044
It's "khoo-vakh."

20
00:00:51,046 --> 00:00:53,216
(Leonard:)Khoo-vakh!

21
00:00:53,215 --> 00:00:55,585
(Leonard:)She took my Where's Waldo.

22
00:00:55,584 --> 00:00:56,884
Well, no, no, he's over there.

23
00:00:56,885 --> 00:01:01,025
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah, there he is.

